<main class="content-block docs-page">
  <h1 class="page-title">Integrate service status</h1>
  <p class="page-lede">A host agent on each server discovers apps, runs checks, and pushes reports to this collector. Public docs — no login required. The ingest key is only on the staff Configure page.</p>

  <nav class="docs-nav" aria-label="Documentation">
    <a href="/docs">Overview</a>
    <a href="/docs/agent">Agent playbook</a>
    <a href="/docs/spec">SPEC</a>
  </nav>

  <section class="docs-section">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Install the <strong>host agent</strong> on each server (runs as root / systemd, typically hourly).</li>
      <li>The agent checks the machine (OS, apt, reboot) and scans <code>scanRoots</code> for Node apps.</li>
      <li>For each app it checks process, Node/npm version, <code>npm audit</code>, and connectors inferred from the app’s <code>config.env</code> / <code>.env</code>.</li>
      <li>It POSTs one report for the host (<code>host:&lt;id&gt;</code>) and one per app, each including a <code>host</code> field so the dashboard nests apps under servers.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>Apps should <strong>not</strong> embed their own status reporters.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="docs-section">
    <h2>Host agent</h2>
    <p>Source and README: repository <code>agent/</code> package (<code>odi-status-agent</code>).</p>
    <pre class="config-snippet">{
  "statusReportUrl": "https://&lt;collector-host&gt;/reports",
  "statusReportKey": "&lt;ingest-key&gt;",
  "hostId": "learndata-1",
  "scanRoots": [
    "/var/www/care.theodi.org",
    "/home/deploy/node-projects/learning-orchestrator"
  ],
  "intervalMs": 3600000
}</pre>
    <p>Allowlist the server’s egress IP on <strong>Configure</strong>. Behind Cloudflare the collector uses <code>CF-Connecting-IP</code> automatically.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="docs-section">
    <h2>Report shape (summary)</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><code>service</code> — upsert key (app name or <code>host:&lt;id&gt;</code>)</li>
      <li><code>host</code> — required server id for nesting</li>
      <li><code>runtime</code> — collector scores Node/OS LTS; agent includes <code>npm_audit</code> in <code>checks</code></li>
      <li><code>checks[]</code> — <code>ok|warn|fail</code></li>
    </ul>
    <p>Full contract: <a href="/docs/spec">/docs/spec</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="docs-section">
    <h2>Legacy in-app client</h2>
    <p>The old downloadable <code>/client/node/</code> sample (push from inside each app) is deprecated. Prefer the host agent.</p>
  </section>
</main>
